  "description": "The story follows Rapunzel and Alice, two girls from different magical worlds, who meet in a mysterious place where worlds, time, and magic connect. When this place starts losing its balance, they have to work together to figure out what is going on and how to bring harmony back.\n\nAlong the way, they learn not every problem gets sorted by strength or speed. The worlds respond when they listen, work as a team, and make thoughtful choices. From their journey, a new world is born, one that grows from curiosity, kindness, and trust instead of strict rules.\n\nIn the end, the story shows that moving forward does not always mean charging ahead, and that real connection happens when different worlds learn to walk together without losing who they are.\n\nAn interactive storybook experience. A linear narrative adventure perfect for young readers to enjoy a captivating tale at their own pace.",
